g AC-001, and a ManaSpendDenied event fired from Spend() when a cast is denied due to insufficient mana (distinct from the existing ManaSpent event) satisfying AC-002. PlayerMana continues to own only current mana and regen-delay state (AC-003) — no spell-local state was touched. Updated PlayerManaUI.cs to subscribe to ManaSpendDenied and briefly flash the fill image to a denied color, giving readable low-mana cast-denial feedback via the existing mana indicator (VAL-002/VAL-003) without requiring new scene-wired UI. No test files or other paths were modified.\",\"claimed_changed_paths\":[\"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMana.cs\",\"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerManaUI.cs\"],\"blockers\":[],\"notes\":[\"Did not run Unity/tests per instructions; existing PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs was read but not modified (it is in the denied write path) so it does not yet cover ResetState() or ManaSpendDenied — extending it is presumably a separate validation task per VAL-001.\",\"Spend(amount) still returns false silently (no event) when amount <= 0, since that is a caller/programming-error case rather than an insufficient-mana denial; ManaSpendDenied is only raised when amount > CurrentMana.\"]}","structured_output":{"summary":"Added to PlayerMana.cs: a public ResetState() method (restores CurrentMana to maxMana and resets the post-cast regen-delay timer; now also called from Awake) satisfying AC-001, and a ManaSpendDenied event fired from Spend() when a cast is denied due to insufficient mana (distinct from the existing ManaSpent event) satisfying AC-002. PlayerMana continues to own only current mana and regen-delay state (AC-003) — no spell-local state was touched. Updated PlayerManaUI.cs to subscribe to ManaSpendDenied and briefly flash the fill image to a denied color, giving readable low-mana cast-denial feedback via the existing mana indicator (VAL-002/VAL-003) without requiring new scene-wired UI. No test files or other paths were modified.","claimed_changed_paths":["Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMana.cs","Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerManaUI.cs"],"blockers":[],"notes":["Did not run Unity/tests per instructions; existing PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs was read but not modified (it is in the denied write path) so it does not yet cover ResetState() or ManaSpendDenied — extending it is presumably a separate validation task per VAL-001.","Spend(amount) still returns false silently (no event) when amount <= 0, since that is a caller/programming-error case rather than an insufficient-mana denial; ManaSpendDenied is only raised when amount > CurrentMana."]},"ttft_ms":1855,"ttft_stream_ms":1120,"time_to_request_ms":32,"type":"result","duration_ms":34889,"uuid":"060052b7-422d-4168-a17d-18eb65604a64"}
